          "title": "Assess ACME Identity Service Automated Account Management",
          "description": "This activity examines the ACME Identity Service configuration for the account-management controls used in the KSI-IAM-AAM demonstration. The assessment evaluates whether automated identity risk signals cause account or sign-in blocking actions before a high-risk session is established. The assessment method is EXAMINE, using read-only configuration and telemetry queries against the ACME Cloud identity tenant."
